  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of a Kigali HFC implementation plan (Stage I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The preparation of the HFC Phase-down Plan for Pakistan was approved at the 97th meeting of the Executive Committee in December 2025. Pakistan endorsed UNIDO to prepare for the country#s Kigali Implementation Plan (KIP) for submission to the 99th ExCom meeting with UNIDO as the lead implementing agency for the submission of the KIP.</narrative>
  </description>
